---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { pages } from '../lib/registry';
---

<Page
  {...pages['/about/']}
  kind="ProfilePage"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Start', href: '/' },
    { label: 'About', href: '/about/' },
  ]}
>
  <header class="page-intro wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Curiosity · Craft · Follow-through</p>
    <h1>Matthew, in person.</h1>
    <p class="intro">
      I work across software, data and practical automation. I like
      understanding how something works, making it useful and explaining the
      decisions along the way.
    </p>
  </header>
  <article class="reading">
    <h2>Useful systems. Human judgment.</h2>
    <p>
      My public work spans data analysis, visualisation, interfaces and
      reproducible software. I bring that engineering approach to small-business
      AI consulting: understand the workflow, choose a bounded improvement and
      make the result inspectable.
    </p>
    <p>
      I work remotely with international clients. Clear scope, documented
      ownership and a practical handover matter as much as the demonstration.
    </p>
    <h2>Outside the work</h2>
    <p>
      Disc golf, video games, backcountry ski touring and board games feed the
      same curiosity in different ways. They also give this paper workshop some
      of its personality.
    </p>
    <h2>Find the evidence</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="/experience/">Explore engineering experience</a>,{' '}
      <a href="/work/">inspect selected projects</a> or{' '}
      <a href="/writing/">read the technical writing</a>.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="/contact/">
      Start a conversation ↗
    </a>
  </article>
</Page>
